  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/dglf/2",
  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">생물의 특성 중 바이러스에 대한 내용을 준비하다가 이 책을 발견하게 되었습니다. 분자생물학의 역사, 과학자들의 삶 등이 알기 쉽게 쓰여있습니다. 저는 고1을 맡고 있는데 이 책에 나온 실험을 수업에 소개하려고 합니다. 예를 들어</span></p><p><br></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 5.7pt 5.7pt 2.8pt 5.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">담배모자이크병이라는 희한한 병이 있다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">담뱃잎에 검은색의 모자이크 모양 반점이 생기는 병으로</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">담배의 상품 가지츨 떨어뜨린다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">이 담배모자이크병에 걸린 잎을 따서 짓이겨 건강한 잎에 묻히면 그 잎에서도 모자이크병이 발생한다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">즉 질병이 전달되는 것이다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그러나 병에 걸린 잎이나 그 잎을 짓이긴 추출액을 현미경으로 관찰해 봐도 특별히 어떤 미생물을 발견할 수는 없었다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 5.7pt 5.7pt 2.8pt 5.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1890</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">년대의 어느 시기에 러시아의 과학자 드미트리 이바노프시키는 그 병원체의 크기를 측정해보려했다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그가 사용한 것은 초벌구이한 도자기 판이었다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">깨진 화분 조각 정도로 생각하면 될 것이다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그 도자기 판에는 그물망 모양의 미세한 구멍이 수도 없이 많이 나있다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. &lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">중략</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">대장균이나 이질균 같은 단세포 미생물은 아무리 작아도 지름이 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">에서 몇 마이크로미터가 된다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">도자기 판에 나 있는 구멍의 크기는 그 크기의 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1/5</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">에서 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1/10 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">이하로 훨씬 작다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">결론적으로</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">단세포생물이 그곳을 통과할 수는 없다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. &lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">중략</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 5.7pt 5.7pt 2.8pt 5.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">이바노프스키는 도자기판을 이용하여 담배모자이크병에 걸린 병든 잎 추출액을 여과해 보았다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그러면 판 반대편으로 스며 나온 액체에는 병원체가 존재하지 않아야 한다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그러나 실험 결과는 이바노프스키의 예상을 뒤집는 것이었다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">도자기 판의 여과액에도 담배모자이크병을 유발하는 힘이 충분히 남아있었다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. &lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">후쿠오카 신이치</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">생물과 무생물 사이 중</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: right; -ms-text-autospace:; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 5.7pt 5.7pt 2.8pt 5.7pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">  </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 5.7pt 5.7pt 2.8pt 5.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">저 부분 말고도 쇤하이머의 실험에 대한 내용이 있는데&nbsp;명제가 멋집니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 5.7pt 5.7pt 2.8pt 5.7pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #000000 0.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">질서는 유지되기 위해 끊임없이 파괴되지 않으면 안된다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">따라서 저자는&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">  </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 생명이란 동적 평형 상태에 있는 흐름이다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">라고 정의를 내립니다. 학생들에게도 소개해주고 싶은 멋진 글입니다. 쇤하이머 실험을 타이핑을 했더니 3페이지나 됩니다.&nbsp;어떻게 줄여서 소개해야할지 생각 중입니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;논술의 문장을 찾거나 생각하는 글을 찾을 때 좋은 책 같습니다.</span><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
